# Line endings
#
# Everything here is stored as LF, and checked out as LF, so a comparison between
# two copies of one file is byte-exact. That matters twice over:
#
# - CodeArts' files were once rewritten as CRLF, which turned a 40-line change
#   into a 12137-line diff, and every review, blame and cherry-pick after it
#   would have carried that noise.
# - `scripts/check.mjs` compares a package's `opencode2.mjs` with the canonical
#   copy in `scripts/` byte for byte. With this repository's `core.autocrlf=true`
#   those two checked out with different endings and the check failed on a file
#   that was in fact identical.
#
# Binaries keep their own bytes.
.gitattributes     text eol=lf
scripts/**         text eol=lf
packages/codearts/** text eol=lf
packages/*/opencode2.mjs text eol=lf

*.exe              binary
*.tgz              binary
*.png              binary
*.ico              binary
*.webp             binary
*.ttf              binary
*.bin              binary